OL,3,AEthiopia acquires Russian fighter jets
OL,4,Aand air defence systems amid war in
OL,5,ATigray
OL,6,
OL,7,FEthiopia has received 12 Su-35 fighter
OL,8,Fjets from Russia, as fighting
OL,9,Fintensified in the northern Tigray
OL,10,Fregion neighbouring Eritrea.
OL,12,FPrime Minister Abiy Ahmed, who is
OL,13,Fattending the Russia-Africa summit in
OL,14,FMoscow, described the acquisition as a
OL,15,F"milestone" that would boost Ethiopia's
OL,16,Fdefence capacity.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
