OL,3,AEthiopia acquires Russian fighter jets
OL,4,Aand air defence systems amid war in
OL,5,ATigray
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said Ethiopia and Russia agreed on
OL,8,Fthe deal several years ago and the
OL,9,Fwarplanes had come ahead of schedule.
OL,10,FHe also said that Ethiopia had plans to
OL,11,Facquire four S-400 air defence systems
OL,12,Ffrom Moscow.
OL,14,FThe Ethiopian leader said the military
OL,15,Fhardware was essential to protect the
OL,16,Fcountry from external threats.
